parameters.jsonBody:
={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'qwen3:4b', stream: false, prompt: `You are helping run a kanban board.

Card title: ${$json.body.job.input?.card?.title || '(untitled)'}
Current description: ${$json.body.job.input?.card?.description || '(empty)'}

Task: ${({ draft_card: 'Write a clear description for this card in 2-4 sentences of plain prose. No headings, no markdown, no preamble.', suggest_labels: 'Suggest 3-5 short labels for this card. Reply with a comma-separated list and nothing else.', estimate_points: 'Estimate this card in Fibonacci story points (1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13). Reply with the number, then one sentence of justification.', split_epic: 'Split this card into 3-6 smaller tasks. Reply as a plain list, one per line, no numbering.' })[$json.body.job.kind] || 'Respond helpfully.'}

Respond with the requested content only. Do not restate the task.` }) }}
